    "local_auto_fix": "Apply SEO fixes directly to your local codebase via CLI. Creates commits and branches ready for you to push.",
    "github_auto_fix": "Automatically create fix PRs via GitHub App integration. No manual intervention required.",
    "gsc_integration": "Connect Google Search Console to track impressions, clicks, CTR, and average position. See which queries drive traffic and monitor keyword rankings.",
